* HyperFiler Pro - GTD Task Management System

** Overview
A well-structured Getting Things Done (GTD) productivity application with cloud synchronization and premium features.

** Architecture

*** Frontend
- Single-page application (hyperfiler-pro.html)
- Things app-inspired design system
- Responsive and mobile-optimized

*** Backend
- Cloudflare Workers API
- D1 database for data persistence
- Serverless architecture

*** Payment Processing
- Stripe integration for premium subscriptions
- Promo code support

** Key Features

*** Task Management
- Full CRUD operations
- Due dates and time tracking
- Templates and repeat functionality
- Event vs task distinction

*** Security
- Robust input sanitization (worker.js:4-149)
- Rate limiting per IP/User-Agent
- SQL injection protection
- XSS attack prevention

*** Multi-tier System
- Free tier with basic features
- Pro tier with advanced capabilities
- Promotional code support

*** Cloud Sync
- User authentication system
- Cross-device synchronization
- Real-time data updates

** Technical Stack

| Component    | Technology           |
|--------------+---------------------|
| Deployment   | Cloudflare Workers  |
| Frontend     | Cloudflare Pages    |
| Database     | Cloudflare D1       |
| Payments     | Stripe API          |
| Styling      | Custom CSS          |
| Language     | JavaScript          |

** Security Measures

*** Input Validation
- Comprehensive sanitization against XSS
- UUID validation for user IDs
- Timestamp format verification

*** Access Control
- Secure query construction
- User-scoped data access
- Password hashing with salt

*** Rate Limiting
- Request throttling by IP
- User-Agent tracking
- Automatic cleanup of old entries

