** Database Schema

*** Core Tables
- users: User accounts and authentication
- user_tasks: Task storage with all GTD fields
- user_subscriptions: Billing and plan management
- user_usage: Usage tracking and metrics
- promo_codes: Promotional code management

*** Indexes
- Optimized queries on user_id
- Fast lookups for due_date
- Efficient stripe_customer_id searches

